1
Product Common Attributes
PCommon

This table contains the fields common to both Products and Product Defaults tables to avoid the duplication of those fields.
The only common fields not included in this table are the memo fields and the reason for this is that we want the memo fields at the end of each table for reasons of speed in calculating the CRC (checksum field) of each record. The actual\\
 problem is that when inheriting fields, this tool places the inherited fields ahead of the "local" fields, which would cause the common memo fields to be placed ahead other non-memo fields.\
\
This problem could be avoided by modifying the physical model to alter the order of the fields to our liking, but this task would have to be done many times when updating the database model.
