1
Product Statistics
PrStats


The reason why the key to this table includes the language is because we want to collect product statistics broken out by language although not broken out by Presentation Method (which also includes the language as one of its attributes).\\
 This is because the statistics collected here are to be used to generate the Most Common Products grid (for the Evolution Self Service's Main Screen) which is meant to include products that have been selected through searches, through\\
 specials, or through any other presentation method. If we did not do it in this way, products that are selected through specials (for example) would not show up on the Main Screen.\
\
At this point no value has been given to collecting statistics across all languages.
